      <div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px">Fluidity</div>
      <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5">Today: 3 min 42 on step 1.</p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#8B5A61">Track the journey time and the refresh rate.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex:1 1 230px;min-width:0;border:1.5px solid #641822;border-radius:8px;padding:20px">
      <div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px">Fewer errors</div>
      <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5">Today: 4.6 errors per session.</p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#8B5A61">Track errors per session and browser backs.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex:1 1 230px;min-width:0;border:1.5px solid #641822;border-radius:8px;padding:20px">
      <div style="font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px">Engagement</div>
      <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5">Today: an empty workspace on arrival.</p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#8B5A61">Track the first action and the 7-day retention.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p style="margin:28px 0 0;max-width:760px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6">I recommend taking a checkpoint at the end of each phase, to check that the effect matches the criticality treated, and to adjust the rest of the roadmap if it does not.</p>
</div>

